The fixed request now returns 200 and shows the check-ins on page `cur_p1`. Looking at the response, there's one check-in with `device_id: "dev-B"`:

```json
{
  "checkins": [
    {"id": "ci-101", "device_id": "dev-A"},
    {"id": "ci-102", "device_id": "dev-A"},
    {"id": "ci-103", "device_id": "dev-C"},
    {"id": "ci-104", "device_id": "dev-B"}
  ],
  "next_cursor": "cur_p2"
}
```

The dev-B check-in on this page (cursor=cur_p1) is `ci-104`.

```json
{
  "dev_b_checkin_id": "ci-104"
}
```
